      "message": "For an invalid path built from i.invalidReason I actually don\u0027t think it\u0027s helpful, because that error isn\u0027t dependent on the requested path. Including it would give the impression it is, which would be misleading.\n\nThe relevant info is which module it expected to be able to deapex from. FindDeapexerProviderForModule adds that in some cases, but I\u0027ve now made it do that consistently.",
