      "writtenOn": "2021-09-21T17:20:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this going to trigger on unbundled builds at all? If so maybe this should cause a fake DeapexerInfo to be created.",
      "revId": "4018b50ac2082677be51022b577ab29602718d0a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
